pening to boëthius so we should tell  a little bit about that story so be  theists as I put it out he's coming from  an ancient Roman family from the  patricians or the elite class and he is  taking part in in politics he's very  well educated he's adopted by another  guy from the patrician class a marcus  after his own father dies and he's  raised by him so Marcus also reads Greek  so be theists perhaps learns in  association with him and Bowie theist is  a great example of a person who's  willing to straddle the active world of  administration politics culture and the  what we might call the academic world of  learning of philosophy of the life of  the mind and he's working with both of  those at the same time it's not the  philosophy that's going to get him in  trouble though it's his association with  some of the people of his own time but  we this appears to have been a genuinely  upstanding person and he gets himself in  trouble because the Senate one of the  one of the members of the Senate  accused of treachery of actually dealing  with just with with the the the Roman  Emperor over in the in the east who had  all these designs on you know taking  parts of Italy so you've got a power  struggle going on there and it'd be like  being accused of treason here in the  United States today you're you're too  close with those people over there  you're gonna let them in you're gonna  help them defeat us and and Byzantine  the Byzantine Empire was a very powerful  force at that time it would be sort of  like you know collaborating with a  rising China or you know a renaissance  Russia at this time not like you know  say collaborating with North Korea it's  like collaborating with a great power  who could swallow you up and so there's  this an informer who as boy theist talks  about you know it's telling these people  hey this guy is a trainer and boy FINA  says well look if he's a traitor then  we're all traitors because you know the  whole Senate is involved in in th